  "description": "<p>PANDORA is a STAMP-derived transactional-memory benchmark suite whose workloads leave conflict detection, version management and transaction scheduling to the TM runtime. Versions from v1.1 on are releases of the development repository https://github.com/tsumulab/pandora; version 1.0 (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23908117) is the one evaluated in the PPoPP 2027 artifact evaluation.</p>",
